{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">楊明近期可謂事業愛情兩得意！早前不但與莊思明（Lisa）拉埋天窗，更將事業版圖強勢擴展至馬來西亞，於吉隆坡投資開設港式燒味店。新店於8月14 日盛大開張，吸引大批食客慕名而來。不過，新店開業僅僅 10 日，今日（24日）突遭當地執法部門查封的消息，震驚一眾網民！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966492010055585414_17240378345.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026xruUaXhzG61787567521.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966492010055585414_17240378345.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有網民在社交平台發文，指原本滿心歡喜想光顧楊明的新店，怎料到達後驚見店舖鐵閘被黃色膠條以「交叉」方式封起，門外更貼上官方告示，嚴禁營業。該網民大感失望留言：「早早過來打算吃的，突然被封店不給做生意？點解啊！！！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">他更無奈表示，上次因為大排長龍食不到，今次特意再來竟然遇上封舖，不禁揣測：「生意太好？」從網上流傳的影片可見，店舖確實已拉下鐵閘，門外引來不少民眾圍觀，大家對店舖突然被封議論紛紛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966491971686115481_17240378345.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026suBk1MiV3D1787567522.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966491971686115481_17240378345.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966491977122030980_17240378345.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026R66m930LQa1787567522.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"sixhubroasthouse_1787062773_3966491977122030980_17240378345.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">對於店舖被查封一事，</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://楊明接受tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">楊明接受tvb.com</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">獨家訪問透露因由：「今日突然間嚟查封，話我哋擺咗啲工具喺後巷個門口隔離，所以要我哋搬番走。」他續說：「我哋依家都處理咗，呢兩日搬番啲嘢入去，後日會重開番舖頭。」</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T10:58:42.255616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}